<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaMaterial/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "This module contains terms and relations enabling representation of material types and their associated properties. Terms for characterizing material usages in internal operation systems are also included (e.g., consumable, process intermediate, final product…)." .
