<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaMaterial/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/MolecularEntity/> .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaMaterial/> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#imports> <https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/202603/biopharma/ReferenceOntologyCandidates/> .
